      "message": "[error] Line 718: 🔴 Camera state can still be overwritten during repeated screen-share starts in the pending/transition window. The guard `if (!call.hasActiveScreenSharing())` depends on media-list propagation timing; if a second `startScreenShare` callback runs before the call is marked as screen-sharing, it recomputes and replaces `cameraMuteStateBeforeScreenShare`, violating the intended “preserve original state across repeated starts.” Use the saved-state field itself as the idempotency guard (e.g., only snapshot when `cameraMuteStateBeforeScreenShare \u003d\u003d null`) and clear it only after stop/restore completes.",
